      <h2>
       A journalist’s curiosity.
       <br/>
       A designer’s eye.
      </h2>
     </div>
     <div>
      <p class="about-lead">
       Good communication starts with understanding the story — and the people it needs to reach.
      </p>
      <p>
       I’m a multimedia journalist, video producer, graphic designer and digital strategist based in Nepal. My work spans news production, public communication, event campaigns and film promotion.
      </p>
      <p>
       From the first idea to the final edit, I focus on clear messages, thoughtful visuals and the details that make a piece feel human.
      </p>
